<title>HUNGARY: Hungary three-month bill yield rises to 20.61 pct.</title>
<headline>Hungary three-month bill yield rises to 20.61 pct.</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1997-05-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>The average annual yield on the latest issue of Hungarian one-month discount treasury bills was set by auction at 20.61 percent, up from 20.59 percent at an auction one week ago, the National Bank of Hungary said.</p>
<p>    Total on offer	     5,000 million forints</p>
<p>    Total bids received	8,611.47 million forints</p>
<p>    Total allocated	    5,000 million forints</p>
<p>    Total issued		 5,000 million forints</p>
<p>    Average annual yield     20.61 pct</p>
<p>    Average price		95.0617 pct</p>
</text>
